# `*.ts diff` forces git to render TypeScript as text in diffs even when a
# blob trips its binary heuristic. Concretely: before the audit-M3 fix,
# src/note-writer.ts contained LITERAL control bytes (a raw NUL and a raw 0x1F)
# inside the CONTROL_CHARS character class, so git classified it as binary and
# showed "Bin 10895 -> 11624 bytes" instead of the one-line change under
# review. Diff-only: this sets no `text`/`eol` attribute, so nothing is
# normalized on checkout and no working tree is rewritten.
#
# Root-lock exception approved 2026-07-28 (see CLAUDE.md "File organization").
*.ts diff
